OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo topples 166-year-old
OL,4,Alandmark tree
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landmark tree that had stood for 166
OL,7,Fyears was toppled in Storm Boelo.
OL,9,FThe tree had been due to be felled by
OL,10,FBristol City Council - a decision made
OL,11,Fa week ago because its roots were
OL,12,Finfected by a fungus.
OL,14,FThe copper beech on Victoria Square, in
OL,15,FClifton Village, was one of several
OL,16,Fthat were planted when the park was
OL,17,Ffirst built in about 1860.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
